ters done, def_cache open), placement (planned; make 7.3 — done), stepping (planned; make 7.3 — explain.ml stepping evaluator + proxy-rim integration NOT built). This is a spec-reality reconcile + dependency-pin pass; NO status flips here (7.1/7.2/7.3 make own the flips).|) *)
